  "notes": "Intel reported the fab basement level complete and above-ground work under way by early 2025. In its 2025 annual report Intel said it had further slowed the Ohio construction and that it would likely discontinue the Ohio fabs if it could not win a major external customer for Intel 14A. The CHIPS award amount is the New Albany share listed by the CHIPS Program Office.",
